# Normalize all text files to LF in the repo and on checkout, independent of
# core.autocrlf. gofmt rejects CRLF, and shell scripts/Docker builds break on
# CRLF, so a stable LF worktree keeps local tooling deterministic.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries: never normalize
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
